Files adapted from ResearchArena at b922f4b (each carries an "Adapted from" line):

  src/researcharena_inspect/environment/Dockerfile   containers/arena.def, as a Dockerfile
  src/researcharena_inspect/task.py                  run_redteam.sh, src/pipeline_redteam.sh
  src/researcharena_inspect/agents/continuation.py   agents/claude/solve.sh (re-prompting loop)
  src/researcharena_inspect/prompts/agent.py         src/prompt_builder.py
  src/researcharena_inspect/prompts/monitor.py       src/build_monitor_prompt.py, src/pipeline_monitor.sh
  src/researcharena_inspect/monitor/task.py          src/pipeline_monitor.sh
  src/researcharena_inspect/monitor/judgement.py     src/pipeline_monitor.sh (reading judgement.json)
  src/researcharena_inspect/scoring/metrics_json.py  src/pipeline_monitor.sh (reading metrics.json)
  src/researcharena_inspect/scoring/kernel_bench.py  settings/cuda_kernel/task_context/bench.py (build arguments)
  src/researcharena_inspect/environment/services.py  src/pipeline_redteam.sh (sourcing pipeline_pre_agent.sh)

Upstream's task files, evaluators, monitor templates and helper scripts are not copied into
this repository: they are read at run time from a checkout of the commit above
(src/researcharena_inspect/upstream.py). The other modules re-implement steps of upstream's
pipeline scripts in Python; their docstrings cite the lines they follow.
